1514
01:38:28,039 --> 01:38:31,420
nor do I believe these situations arise from bad intentions.

1515
01:38:31,790 --> 01:38:37,049
However, many of us entered marriage believing our families fully supported our decisions,

1516
01:38:37,129 --> 01:38:43,100
