1517
01:38:43,970 --> 01:38:47,667
Whether it is a wedding related decision, family traditions,

1518
01:38:47,747 --> 01:38:50,761
expectations that were never clearly communicated,

1519
01:38:50,841 --> 01:38:56,287
or even topics like engagement rings and dowry, the details differ from family to family,

1520
01:38:56,367 --> 01:38:59,600
but the pattern often feels remarkably similar.

1521
01:39:00,290 --> 01:39:02,567
The issue of dowry is one example.

1522
01:39:02,647 --> 01:39:07,425
Growing up, I genuinely believed my family viewed such thinking as outdated.

1523
01:39:07,505 --> 01:39:16,121
